  <p>
    This guide walks through creating a new DTRules project. We'll build a simple discount
    calculation system to demonstrate the process.
  </p>

  <div class="glass rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-purple-500 my-6">
    <p class="mb-0">
      <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-xs font-medium rounded-full">Go</span>
      <strong class="ml-2">This guide uses Go CLI tools.</strong>
      See <a href="/docs/getting-started/choosing-implementation">Choosing an Implementation</a>
      for an overview of available tools.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Project Setup</h2>

  <h3>1. Copy the Template</h3>

  <p>Start with the TestProject template:</p>

  <pre><code>cp -r sampleprojects/TestProject sampleprojects/MyProject
cd sampleprojects/MyProject</code></pre>

  <h3>2. Update Configuration</h3>

  <p>Edit <code>DTRules.xml</code> with your project details:</p>

  <pre><code>&lt;DTRules&gt;
  &lt;compiler&gt;EL&lt;/compiler&gt;

  &lt;RuleSet name="MyProject" source="file"&gt;
    &lt;RuleSetFilePath&gt;/xml&lt;/RuleSetFilePath&gt;
    &lt;WorkingDirectory&gt;/temp&lt;/WorkingDirectory&gt;

    &lt;DTExcelFolder&gt;/DecisionTables/&lt;/DTExcelFolder&gt;
    &lt;EDDExcelFolder&gt;/edd/&lt;/EDDExcelFolder&gt;

    &lt;Entities        name="MyProject_edd.xml" /&gt;
    &lt;Decisiontables  name="MyProject_dt.xml"  /&gt;
    &lt;Map             name="MyProject_map.xml" /&gt;
  &lt;/RuleSet&gt;
&lt;/DTRules&gt;</code></pre>

  <h3>3. Update pom.xml</h3>

  <pre><code>&lt;groupId&gt;com.mycompany&lt;/groupId&gt;
&lt;artifactId&gt;myproject&lt;/artifactId&gt;
&lt;version&gt;1.0-SNAPSHOT&lt;/version&gt;
&lt;name&gt;MyProject&lt;/name&gt;</code></pre>

